<title>SOUTH KOREA: Baseball-Results of S.Korean professional games.</title>
<headline>Baseball-Results of S.Korean professional games.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of South Korean professional baseball games played on Monday.</p>
<p>    Haitai		   3	Ssangbangwool    2</p>
<p>NOTE - Hanwha, Hyundai, Lotte, Samsung, LG and OB did not play on Monday.</p>
<p>- Monday's match was the last one for this year.</p>
<p>(final placings tabulated under won, drawn, lost, winning percentage, games behind first place)</p>
<p>			  W   D    L     PCT	   GB</p>
<p>    Haitai	   73   2   51    .587	    -</p>
<p>    Ssangbangwool  70   2   54    .563	    3</p>
<p>    Hanwha	   70   1   55    .560	3 1/2</p>
<p>    Hyundai	  67   5   54    .552	4 1/2</p>
<p>    Lotte	    57   6   63    .476	   14</p>
<p>    Samsung	  54   5   67    .448     17 1/2</p>
<p>    LG		 50   5   71    .417     21 1/2</p>
<p>    OB		 47   6   73    .397	   24</p>
